      "role": "registrar",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "We are in open session, Your Honours."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ORIE",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Thank you, Madam Registrar. We adjourn for the day, and we resume tomorrow, Wednesday, the 10th of November, quarter past 2.00 in this same Courtroom II. But I already inform the public that the first thing we'll do tomorrow is to move into closed session again. We stand adjourned."
    },
    {
